---
layout: inner.njk
title: "Обекти — Ритеил парк Раковски"
description: "Разгледайте всички магазини и партньори в Ритеил парк Раковски."
---

{# ── Page hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="bg-white/80 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-3">
      <span class="mt-1.5 block h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-brand-yellow)]"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--color-brand-yellow)]">Магазини &amp; Партньори</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      Всичко на<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      <span class="text-[var(--color-brand-teal)]">едно място</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Водещи марки, разнообразни услуги и удобен паркинг — открийте всички търговски обекти в Ритеил парк Раковски.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Partners grid ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for shop in shops.items %}
      <a
        href="{{ ('/obekti/' + shop.slug + '/') | url }}"
        class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.07] ring-1 ring-slate-200/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/[0.12]"
      >
        {# Accent bar #}
        <span
          class="block h-1.5 w-full shrink-0"
          style="background-color: {{ shop.color }};"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>

        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6 sm:p-7">
          {# Logo #}
          <div class="flex h-16 items-center">
            <img
              src="{{ shop.logo | url }}"
              alt="{{ shop.title }}"
              class="max-h-12 max-w-[140px] object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          {# Info #}
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-[var(--color-brand-teal)] transition-colors">{{ shop.title }}</h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">{{ shop.category }}</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">{{ shop.description }}</p>
          </div>

          {# CTA arrow #}
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-brand-teal)] transition group-hover:gap-2.5">
            Виж повече
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l5 5a1 1 0 010 1.414l-5 5a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L11.586 10 7.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
